# This is a placeholder file to show where to place OBJ model files
# You should replace this with actual 3D models in OBJ format

# For example, you might have a file like:
# arcade-machine.obj
# character.obj

# These files would typically be exported from 3D modeling software like Blender

# OBJ File Format Example:
# v 0.0 0.0 0.0
# v 1.0 0.0 0.0
# v 1.0 1.0 0.0
# v 0.0 1.0 0.0
# vt 0.0 0.0
# vt 1.0 0.0
# vt 1.0 1.0
# vt 0.0 1.0
# vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
# f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
# f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
